;; compiler/emit/lower/mod.fib: lowering a body (spec/compiler.md §4): `emit_body`, `emit_closure`, the expression and value walkers and the small
;; emitters of the context. Replaces crates/fibc/src/lower/mod.rs; its data is in emit.lower.cx. `float_text`
;; (mod.rs:493) is `float-lir-text` of emit.text (real, tested).
;; STATUS: every public function below is a STUB of package E4, `(trap "todo: PACKAGE NAME")`,
;; with the Rust it replaces in the comment above it (crates/fibc/src/lower/mod.rs, 501 lines of Rust).
;; A stub reached makes a tool exit 70 (pending, never a pass); its signature is final for the callers,
;; the data it names is the porter's to extend.
(ns emit.lower.mod
  (:use types.ty types.ast types.program own.program syntax.form emit.value emit.ir emit.mono emit.program emit.lower.cx))

